### Create product
POST http://localhost:4000/api/products/create-prod
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
"brand": "demo-brand",
"category": "top",
"gender": "M",
"description": "Demo description",
"quantity": 0,
"daysOfDelivery": 5,
"origPrice": 499,
"discountPrice": 399,
"image": "demo-image"
}

